{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbedding","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.MarkovTraceInstance","lean:module:QOU.QBeta.MarkovTraceQuotient","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeWedderburnGeneral","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.TraceQuotCatalan","lean:module:Mathlib.RingTheory.TwoSidedIdeal.Kernel"],"declarations":64,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.finrank_range_jimbo_eq_catalan","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.finrank_range_jimbo_eq_catalan","kind":"theorem","line":780,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L780-L793","doc":"**The image of the Jimbo action has dimension `catalan (m+1)`.**  The block count of\n`finrank_range_jimbo` is the one `TraceQuotCatalan.finrank_traceQuot_eq_catalan` evaluates\n(via `twoRowIdxEquiv`, `numSYT_twoRow_eq_ballot`, `dimHLF_two_row_sq_sum`).  Over `ℝ`\nbecause that evaluation is stated over `ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.finrank_range_jimbo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.finrank_range_jimbo","kind":"theorem","line":754,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L754-L778","doc":"**Dimension of the image of the Jimbo action** = `∑_{ℓ(λ) ≤ 2} (#SYT λ)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_twoRowProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_twoRowProd","kind":"theorem","line":740,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L740-L752","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.twoRowProd_surjective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.twoRowProd_surjective","kind":"theorem","line":728,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L728-L738","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.twoRowProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.twoRowProd","kind":"def","line":719,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L719-L726","doc":"The projection onto the at-most-two-row seminormal blocks (any ordered field;\n`WtraceRadicalIdeal.twoRowProduct` is the `ℝ` instance of the same map). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.heckeActionN_eq_zero_iff_twoRow_blocks_vanish","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.heckeActionN_eq_zero_iff_twoRow_blocks_vanish","kind":"theorem","line":700,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L700-L708","doc":"The same, for `heckeActionN` itself. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_twoRow_blocks_vanish","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_twoRow_blocks_vanish","kind":"theorem","line":689,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L689-L698","doc":"**Kohno comparison at `sl₂`, kernel form.** The Jimbo action kills `x` exactly when every\nseminormal block with at most two rows does: the kernel is the sum of the blocks with three\nor more rows. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.twoRow_block_eq_zero_of_jimbo_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.twoRow_block_eq_zero_of_jimbo_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":649,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L649-L687","doc":"**Every at-most-two-row block survives.** If the Jimbo action kills `x`, so does every\nseminormal block with at most two rows. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_eq_zero_of_twoRow_blocks_vanish","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_eq_zero_of_twoRow_blocks_vanish","kind":"theorem","line":631,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L631-L647","doc":"**Every block with three or more rows acts by zero.** An element killed by every\nat-most-two-row seminormal block is killed by the Jimbo action. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.heckeActionN_eq_zero_iff_wtrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.heckeActionN_eq_zero_iff_wtrace","kind":"theorem","line":614,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L614-L621","doc":"**The same statement for `heckeActionN` itself**, read through the presentation\nequivalence `skeinCoxAEquiv : Hecke L q q⁻¹ m ≃ₐ BalancedHecke (coxA m) q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.ker_jimbo_eq_traceRadicalIdeal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.ker_jimbo_eq_traceRadicalIdeal","kind":"theorem","line":602,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L602-L612","doc":"**The kernel of the Jimbo action is the trace-radical ideal of `wtrace`**, as\ntwo-sided ideals. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_wtrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_wtrace","kind":"theorem","line":591,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L591-L600","doc":"**Kernel of the Jimbo action = radical of the Ocneanu trace form** (pointwise). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_qtr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_qtr","kind":"theorem","line":580,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L580-L589","doc":"`x` acts by zero iff it is in the radical of the weighted trace form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.eq_zero_of_qtr_mul_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.eq_zero_of_qtr_mul_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":560,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L560-L578","doc":"**The weighted trace form is positive definite on `X ↦ X Xᵀ`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.dWeight_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.dWeight_pos","kind":"theorem","line":553,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L553-L558","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimboTrace_eq_wtrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimboTrace_eq_wtrace","kind":"theorem","line":533,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L533-L539","doc":"**The Jimbo trace is the Ocneanu weighted seminormal trace**, by uniqueness of the\nconvention-D Markov trace.  Any field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimboMarkov","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimboMarkov","kind":"def","line":511,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L511-L531","doc":"**The weighted trace of the Jimbo action is a Markov trace at convention D**,\n`z = q³/(q² + 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimboTrace_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimboTrace_apply","kind":"theorem","line":508,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L508-L509","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimboTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimboTrace","kind":"def","line":503,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L503-L506","doc":"**The normalised weighted trace of the Jimbo action**\n`x ↦ Tr(K^{⊗(n+1)} ρ(x)) / (1 + q²)^{n+1}`, `K = diag(1, q²)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.qtrLin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.qtrLin","kind":"def","line":497,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L497-L501","doc":"`qtr` as a linear functional. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_last","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_last","kind":"theorem","line":492,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L492-L495","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_heckeIncl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_heckeIncl","kind":"theorem","line":481,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L481-L490","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.transpose_jimbo_mem_range","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.transpose_jimbo_mem_range","kind":"theorem","line":465,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L465-L473","doc":"**The image of the Jimbo action is closed under transpose.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.transposeSub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.transposeSub","kind":"def","line":452,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L452-L463","doc":"The matrices whose transpose lies in a given subalgebra form a subalgebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.embedPair_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.embedPair_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":444,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L444-L450","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.rCheck_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.rCheck_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":440,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L440-L442","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.qtr_jimbo_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.qtr_jimbo_comm","kind":"theorem","line":435,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L435-L438","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.qtr_eq_trace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.qtr_eq_trace","kind":"theorem","line":431,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L431-L433","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.dMat_commute_jimbo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.dMat_commute_jimbo","kind":"theorem","line":421,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L421-L429","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.dMat_commute_embedPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.dMat_commute_embedPair","kind":"theorem","line":413,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L413-L419","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.dMat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.dMat","kind":"def","line":409,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L409-L411","doc":"`K^{⊗n}` as a diagonal matrix. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.dWeight_eq_of_embedPair_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.dWeight_eq_of_embedPair_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":388,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L388-L407","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.rCheck_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.rCheck_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":382,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L382-L386","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.jimbo_mem","kind":"theorem","line":367,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L367-L380","doc":"Everything in the image of `jimbo` lies in any subalgebra containing the strand\nbraidings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.qtr_extLast_mul_last","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.qtr_extLast_mul_last","kind":"theorem","line":324,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L324-L358","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.partial_last","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.partial_last","kind":"theorem","line":281,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L281-L322","doc":"The partial `K`-trace of `Ř` over the appended last site is `q³` times the identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.embedPair_castSucc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.embedPair_castSucc","kind":"theorem","line":253,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L253-L275","doc":"A two-site operator at sites `i, j < N` of `V^{⊗(N+1)}` is the extension of the same\noperator on `V^{⊗N}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.qtr_extLast","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.qtr_extLast","kind":"theorem","line":245,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L245-L251","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.extLast_snoc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.extLast_snoc","kind":"theorem","line":239,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L239-L243","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.extLast_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.extLast_apply","kind":"theorem","line":232,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L232-L237","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.extLast","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.extLast","kind":"def","line":225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L225-L230","doc":"`X ↦ X ⊗ 1`, the new tensor factor appended last, as an algebra map. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.snocE","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.snocE","kind":"def","line":221,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L221-L223","doc":"`(Fin N → Fin 2) × Fin 2 ≃ (Fin (N+1) → Fin 2)`, the new site appended last. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.qtr_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.qtr_one","kind":"theorem","line":211,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L211-L213","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.sum_dWeight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.sum_dWeight","kind":"theorem","line":204,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboActionKernel.lean#L204-L209","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.sum_wt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel.su